forge_flux3/native/transformer.py, forge_flux3/native/text_engine.py and forge_flux3/native/scheduler.py
are adapted from FLUX 3 Image Klein's reference inference code
(https://github.com/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein, commit 45e57c9, src/flux3/dit.py, text_encoder.py
and sampling.py), Copyright Black Forest Labs, Apache License 2.0. These files were modified to run inside
Forge Neo. tests/reference/flux3_dit.py is src/flux3/dit.py of the same commit, unmodified, used only by the
tests.

The batched layout of the DiT and the INT8 checkpoint handling follow ComfyUI's FLUX 3 support
(https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI, commit 20b4606, GNU General Public License v3.0).

forge_flux3/native/huggingface/flux3-image/tokenizer/ and text_encoder/ are the tokenizer and configuration
of Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct), Alibaba Cloud, Apache License
2.0, as Forge Neo ships them for Krea 2. vae/config.json is the FLUX.2 autoencoder configuration as Forge Neo
ships it.

The FLUX 3 Image Klein weights are not part of this extension. They are released by Black Forest Labs under
the FLUX Kommunity License (https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy).
